1. Her name is Elias Delaria and she is a British VTuber. (Verbatim: "hi, I'm Elias Delaria, British VTuber")
2. She has a disrupted sleeping pattern and often does not get the recommended amount of sleep. (Verbatim: "my sleeping pattern is so wrecked and ready for it though")
3. She stayed up until around 3 a.m. the previous night, which she references as a common occurrence. (Verbatim: "last time I think it was like 3 a.m. or something")
4. She associates 3 a.m. with a peaceful, quiet time of day. (Verbatim: "3am's not too bad a time... It's that perfect moment where I think the majority of people are, like, asleep.")
5. She consumed a sports drink instead of coffee due to being late, indicating a reliance on quick energy sources. (Verbatim: "I was gonna make a coffee, but then I was already really late, so I was like, oh, I'll just grab a sports drink")
6. She studied naked mole rats during her university education. (Verbatim: "I had to go over them at uni for a bit, because they're, they're really interesting creatures")
7. She has prior academic exposure to biological topics, such as cellular resistance in animals. (Verbatim: "transformation of naked mole rat cells, like, I had to go over them at uni for a bit")
8. She expresses difficulty with time zones, indicating she has an international audience. (Verbatim: "because time zones are my enemy")
9. She refers to her stream as “yawn simulator,” suggesting a self-aware, humorous take on her tired state. (Verbatim: "welcome to yawn simulator, I shall yawn, you shall yawn back")
10. She plans to play Lethal Company in a future stream, indicating interest in horror or cooperative games. (Verbatim: "tomorrow evening, will you hold my sweaty hand, onnagaishimasu, as we play lethal company") [end of text]



