3. She has experience caring for porcupines in a past role as a "seed keeper," which involved cleaning enclosures and handling animals. (Verbatim: "whenever i dealt with the porcupines we had these like literal um shields... i had to usher them out to like clean their their the inside of their like little home")

4. She once had a porcupine quill go under her thumbnail, causing significant pain. (Verbatim: "what i have had before is one go up my nail and hurt my thumb very uh very much so")

