7. She expresses concern about animals being sold for high prices and values placing pets in loving homes over profit. (Verbatim: "I don't want her to end up being like a working dog or something and she was like I want to the dog goes to a loving home so I was like then she was like I choose you")

8. She finds Sphinx cats unattractive but acknowledges they are just regular cats without fur. (Verbatim: "it just really really lacks attractiveness... pretty much the same as your regular cat just cat no fur right")

9. She has looked up pet prices online, noting Samoyed puppies can cost between $1600 and $2300. (Verbatim: "samoyed puppies 1600 2300 yo what guys no wonder people don't have samoyeds")

10. She has never watched the animated show *Kim Possible*. (Verbatim: "i never watched it i'll be honest") [end of text]



1. She has experience looking after owls. (Verbatim: "none of the owls i looked after were luckily naked")
